{"html": "<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 05 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">自监督学习：对比、聚类、自蒸馏与遮挡重建</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Self-Supervised Learning</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_027_dino-title\">DINO</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">无负样本的 EMA teacher–student 跨视图概率匹配，以 centering 与 sharpening 防止塌缩。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Negative-free self-distillation where a student ViT matches the centered, temperature-sharpened probability distribution of an EMA teacher across multi-crop views.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">同一图像的多尺度全局与局部 crops</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">2 global views and multiple local lower-resolution crops of an unlabeled image</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">无需标签的 ViT 图像与 patch 表征</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Self-distilled ViT global [CLS] and dense patch representations</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 2 · PDF p.2</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始方法示意图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/ICCV2021/html/Caron_Emerging_Properties_in_Self-Supervised_Vision_Transformers_ICCV_2021_paper.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_027_dino')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_027_dino')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"DINO original paper architecture figure, Figure 2\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/b191f9e8afec488c0169.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 2 · PDF p.2</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 9 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_027_dino', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_027_dino\" onclick=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_027_dino')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_027_dino', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_027_dino\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 09 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">Multi-Crop 视图</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Multi-Crop</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">每图生成两个全局 crop 和多个局部 crop；teacher 只看全局视图。</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests 2 global views and multiple local lower-resolution crops of an unlabeled image and prepares initial tensor representations (Multi-Crop).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"每图生成两个全局 crop 和多个局部 crop；teacher 只看全局视图。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests 2 global views and multiple local lower-resolution crops of an unlabeled image and prepares initial tensor representations (Multi-Crop).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"Multi-Crop 视图\" data-node-name-en=\"Multi-Crop\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_027_dino', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">Multi-Crop 视图</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Multi-Crop</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">每图生成两个全局 crop 和多个局部 crop；teacher 只看全局视图。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests 2 global views and multiple local lower-resolution crops of an unlabeled image and prepares initial tensor representations (Multi-Crop).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"student 处理全部全局与局部视图并接收梯度。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Student ViT to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"Student ViT\" data-node-name-en=\"Student ViT\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_027_dino', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Student ViT</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">student 处理全部全局与局部视图并接收梯度。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Student ViT to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"MLP 与归一化/权重归一化层输出高维概率 logits。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Student Head within the core self distillation ema teacher computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"Student Head\" data-node-name-en=\"Student Head\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_027_dino', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Student Head</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">MLP 与归一化/权重归一化层输出高维概率 logits。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Student Head within the core self distillation ema teacher computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"teacher 与 student 同构，参数由 student 的指数移动平均更新。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs EMA Teacher within the core self distillation ema teacher computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"EMA Teacher\" data-node-name-en=\"EMA Teacher\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_027_dino', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>EMA Teacher</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">teacher 与 student 同构，参数由 student 的指数移动平均更新。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs EMA Teacher within the core self distillation ema teacher computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"仅对全局 crops 生成无梯度目标分布。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Teacher Head within the core self distillation ema teacher computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"Teacher Head\" data-node-name-en=\"Teacher Head\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_027_dino', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Teacher Head</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">仅对全局 crops 生成无梯度目标分布。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Teacher Head within the core self distillation ema teacher computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"teacher logits 减去移动中心并用较低温度锐化，协同避免塌缩。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Center + Sharpen within the core self distillation ema teacher computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"Center + Sharpen\" data-node-name-en=\"Center + Sharpen\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_027_dino', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Center + Sharpen</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">teacher logits 减去移动中心并用较低温度锐化，协同避免塌缩。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Center + Sharpen within the core self distillation ema teacher computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"每个 teacher 全局视图监督来自另一视图的 student 输出。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Cross-View CE within the core self distillation ema teacher computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"Cross-View CE\" data-node-name-en=\"Cross-View CE\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_027_dino', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Cross-View CE</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">每个 teacher 全局视图监督来自另一视图的 student 输出。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Cross-View CE within the core self distillation ema teacher computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"训练后期提高 teacher 动量，使目标平滑稳定。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies update to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"动量更新\" data-node-name-en=\"update\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_027_dino', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">动量更新</span><span class=\"lang-en\">update</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">训练后期提高 teacher 动量，使目标平滑稳定。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies update to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"导出 student/teacher backbone；ViT attention 常呈现无监督对象区域。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces self-distilled vit global [cls] and dense patch representations via feature.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"语义特征\" data-node-name-en=\"feature\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_027_dino', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">语义特征</span><span class=\"lang-en\">feature</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">导出 student/teacher backbone；ViT attention 常呈现无监督对象区域。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces self-distilled vit global [cls] and dense patch representations via feature.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"DINO Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · DINO 中心锐化教师与 EMA 自蒸馏</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · EMA Teacher–Student Cross-View Distillation with Centering &amp; Sharpening</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"DINO：核心公式 · DINO 中心锐化教师与 EMA 自蒸馏\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"27\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"26.341602pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-69.028346 -69.00913 354.821