5\" xlink:href=\"#m027_g7-185\" y=\"-54.393543\"></use><use x=\"168.372726\" xlink:href=\"#m027_g16-71\" y=\"-54.393543\"></use><use x=\"173.095017\" xlink:href=\"#m027_g20-50\" y=\"-52.899162\"></use><use x=\"177.229507\" xlink:href=\"#m027_g7-186\" y=\"-54.393543\"></use><use x=\"181.045183\" xlink:href=\"#m027_g16-150\" y=\"-54.393543\"></use><use x=\"195.397966\" xlink:href=\"#m027_g16-92\" y=\"-54.393543\"></use><use x=\"200.256251\" xlink:href=\"#m027_g13-67\" y=\"-52.899162\"></use><use x=\"206.46715\" xlink:href=\"#m027_g7-32\" y=\"-54.393543\"></use><use x=\"219.505966\" xlink:href=\"#m027_g16-60\" y=\"-54.393543\"></use><use x=\"227.246922\" xlink:href=\"#m027_g16-92\" y=\"-54.393543\"></use><use x=\"232.105207\" xlink:href=\"#m027_g13-67\" y=\"-52.899162\"></use><use x=\"237.762639\" xlink:href=\"#m027_g7-184\" y=\"-54.393543\"></use><use x=\"246.810875\" xlink:href=\"#m027_g7-185\" y=\"-54.393543\"></use><use x=\"250.526936\" xlink:href=\"#m027_g23-49\" y=\"-54.393543\"></use><use x=\"257.722122\" xlink:href=\"#m027_g7-0\" y=\"-54.393543\"></use><use x=\"266.341962\" xlink:href=\"#m027_g16-60\" y=\"-54.393543\"></use><use x=\"273.953409\" xlink:href=\"#m027_g7-186\" y=\"-54.393543\"></use><use x=\"277.898594\" xlink:href=\"#m027_g16-92\" y=\"-54.393543\"></use><use x=\"282.865972\" xlink:href=\"#m027_g13-66\" y=\"-52.899162\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">无标签 ViT 缺少稳定的语义学习目标与 collapse 控制，对比方法又依赖负样本</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Contrastive ViTs required explicit negative pairs or memory banks, while naive self-distillation collapsed to trivial constant outputs.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">student 预测 EMA teacher 在多 crop 上的锐化、居中分布，无标签无显式负样本</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Train a student network to predict the output distribution of a momentum-updated teacher across global-to-local crops, preventing collapse via centering and sharpening.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">self-distillation、EMA、stop-gradient、centering 与 multi-crop</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Multi-crop local-to-global correspondence + EMA teacher centering/sharpening yielding emergent object part segmentation in ViT attention.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">其 patch 表示直接启发病理和放射 foundation encoder</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Directly underpins pathology tile foundation models (UNI, Virchow) and radiology self-supervised ViTs.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">DINOv2 的直接祖先；机制与 collapse 控制仍必须理解</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Essential precursor to DINOv2; emergent attention maps reflect spatial grouping but should not be over-interpreted as causal proof.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">teacher 不由标签训练，而是 student 参数的平滑时间集成，构成自蒸馏目标。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">跨视图一致性要求局部 crop 与不同全局 crop 指向同一语义表示。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">centering 抵消单一维度偏置、sharpening 避免均匀输出，两者共同抑制无负样本训练塌缩。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Train a student network to predict the output distribution of a momentum-updated teacher across global-to-local crops, preventing collapse via centering and sharpening.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Multi-crop local-to-global correspondence + EMA teacher centering/sharpening yielding emergent object part segmentation in ViT attention.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: EMA Teacher–Student Cross-View Distillation with Centering &amp; Sharpening.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">多裁剪可从整张病理图与局部组织区域学习尺度一致性，但局部 crop 不应丢失诊断上下文。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">无标签 attention 的区域性不等于病灶定位；仍需以标注任务和外部中心验证其临床可读性。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Directly underpins pathology tile foundation models (UNI, Virchow) and radiology self-supervised ViTs.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Essential precursor to DINOv2; emergent attention maps reflect spatial grouping but should not be over-interpreted as causal proof.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/ICCV2021/html/Caron_Emerging_Properties_in_Self-Supervised_Vision_Transformers_ICCV_2021_paper.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>Emerging Properties in Self-Supervised Vision Transformers</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/facebookresearch/dino\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}